node_modules
dist
*.local
.DS_Store

# Build-time assets, produced by `npm run assets` (the prebuild/predev step).
# Neither is a source of truth: the worker is a verbatim copy of
# runtimes/java/src/jvm.worker.js, and ecj.jar is fetched + sha256-verified by
# runtimes/java/fetch-compiler.sh (*.jar is gitignored repo-wide for licensing).
public/warsha-jvm.worker.js
public/ecj.jar
# The C# engine bundle (dotnet _framework + module worker), built + staged by
# runtimes/csharp/build.sh. Large build product, never a source of truth.
public/warsha-dotnet/
# The esbuild bundler wasm, a verbatim copy of node_modules/esbuild-wasm/
# esbuild.wasm (used to transpile/bundle TypeScript and cross-file JS/TS modules
# in the browser). ~12 MB build product, never a source of truth.
public/warsha-esbuild.wasm
# The on-device Tailwind build, a verbatim copy of node_modules/@tailwindcss/
# browser/dist/index.global.js — injected into the preview so Tailwind utilities
# work offline and under COEP (a cross-origin CDN <script> would be blocked).
# ~276 KB build product, never a source of truth.
public/warsha-tailwind.js
